            "detailed_description": "Who said that only brave knights on white stallions can become Heroes? Witness the incredible adventures of  a rustic Fool; travel with him to a fascinating world and help him save the beautiful princess Catherine from the jaws of a terrible dragon. A Hero lives in every one of us!  Journey to set your Hero free!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n–\tHelp the Fool defeat the beastly dragon.<br />\r\n–\tVisit the land of zombies.<br />\r\n–\tTravel to Steam City – the steampunk industrial center in decline.<br />\r\n–\tUnveil a kingdom floating in the clouds and solve the mystery behind the UFO.<br />\r\n–\tLocate dragon's lair and save princess Catherine.<br />\r\n–\tBecome a Hero!<br />\r\n–\tMany ingenious puzzles and subtle humor!",
